WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
How they voted by party.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.825
The Liberal Party voted overwhelmingly in favour of both bills.

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:10.087
The Bloc Quebecois supported expansion.

00:00:10.087 --> 00:00:12.550
The NDP was divided.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.537
The Conservatives largely opposed.

00:00:15.537 --> 00:00:23.037
The party breakdown reveals that MAID legalization and expansion was driven almost entirely by Liberal and Bloc votes.
